# Pairs with MovedStreamKeepsAckedWrites. The GC trims to the allocator's head
# rather than below what the consumer has read - the lagging-consumer
# fall-off-the-log class WalGcTrimFloorModel pins at the core level.
MODULE: MovedStreamKeepsAckedWritesTrimPastConsumer
TARGET: MovedStreamKeepsAckedWrites
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the GC trims past the consumer's read position
PERTURBS: GcTrim

--- FIND
         /\ t - 1 <= cons
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the trim ignores the consumer.
         /\ t - 1 < next
--- END